{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33335","headline":"及第後寄梁烛处士 · 伊璠","name":"及第後寄梁烛处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绣毂寻芳许史家，独将羁事达江沙。\n十年辛苦一枝桂，二月艳阳千树花。\n鹏化四溟归碧落，鹤栖三岛接青霞。\n同袍不得同游翫，今对春风日又斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伊璠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33335.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33335","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}